{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the sole operator of a remote outpost. Each day, you wake up, monitor power levels, maintain the generator, and tune the endless stream of mysterious signals that pulse through the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the transmissions grow stranger, new sections of the outpost begin to open. Descend into the abstract depths of the facility and uncover it's mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Document transmissions, store your findings, and send daily reports to maintain funding and uncover new depths of the facility. As the days stretch on, the systems begin to fail\u2014and strange anomalies creep into your routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129460/extras/b9d2b1eaf92a480554c468b4d80e3e28.poster.avif?t=1762375005\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129460/extras/b9d2b1eaf92a480554c468b4d80e3e28.webm?t=1762375005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129460/extras/b9d2b1eaf92a480554c468b4d80e3e28.mp4?t=1762375005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate analogue consoles with tactile switches and dials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune and decode strange transmissions across a living day\u2013night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain power systems to keep the outpost running</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore deeper into the facility to uncover long-buried rooms and forgotten equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a dynamic anomaly system that warps both your tools and surroundings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129460/extras/812c2757363d997cc254bde6ed1b7683.poster.avif?t=1762375005\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129460/extras/812c2757363d997cc254bde6ed1b7683.webm?t=1762375005\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129460/extras/812c2757363d997cc254bde6ed1b7683.mp4?t=1762375005\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently in prototype phase. A first trailer and early playable build are coming soon. Feedback from early players will directly help shape the systems and atmosphere of the final release.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4129460?t=1762375005","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129460/5ddf99ef0e23b9771cde025246bef998288f0e12/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762375005","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129460/6f7a12f911dbf33ffea9ce8e30c75226b961435c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762375005","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4129460/6f7a12f911dbf33ffea9ce8e30c75226b961435c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762375005","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the sole operator of a remote outpost. Each day, you wake up,